                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجِينٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>One whose father is free,</i> or <i>an Arab,
and whose mother is a slave.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A
horse [<i>half-blooded</i>] <i>got by a stallion of generous
